       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/dr835xg3992.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Six-figure stamp in black ink, every figure plain: 8 1 1 0 2 5. Read as day-month-year it gives day 81, which is impossible, so the day is not recoverable. If the last four figures are month and year, as on other stamped rolls in this batch, the month is October and the year 1925. 3335 is written in pencil on region 4; region 3 holds only a smudge."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
